Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope that we'll never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.14,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Npause, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We are whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.70,0:01:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that\NI want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you in our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.70,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that I wanna take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head forth and.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.60,0:02:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd Rage you go? No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess she had something to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Black tea! Green tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Black tea! Green tea!\NBlack tea! Green tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, here's a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Sanji and his wife going to live\Nafter this whole nutty wedding is over?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In Germa, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:03:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, she's\Nessential to keep us a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, who knows what\Ndemands they'll make.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.84,0:03:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We are dealing with pirates, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really on top of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we know if Big Mom's\Nnot thinking the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she wants to keep\NSanji as her hostage?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you saying, Niji?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's useless as a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Big Mom does end up killing\Nhim, would any of us give a damn?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, how sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be fun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Having our little brother\Naround like old times?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so ready to eat dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm full of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anybody hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Blaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll put all that tender young\Nflesh to good use. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm using it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be so happy to shut you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.70,0:04:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel deck your own grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There was too much chaos\Nfor them to notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But the carrot that got captured\Nwith me was actually a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an animal that was transformed into a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.84,0:05:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,mirror image of carrot by Brulé's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A frog, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The real carrot is putting on an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting for me to make my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat me! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Cabral!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for the frog,\Nbut this is our only shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We have 16 enemies to deal with in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The most troubling ones are\NRandolph, the Aristocroc,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And probably that chimney guy, Diesel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, and Barrel, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My only chance is to catch them off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll strike the moment\Nthey drop the fake carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Randolph, cut the rope for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:05:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll flip out once we drop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.56,0:06:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta put the lid on right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.86,0:06:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Carrot, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiding up for the throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing down\Nthere, Randolph? Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.66,0:06:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone came from the attic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we have two rabbit girls now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.76,0:06:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.32,0:07:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrie, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, chow-will!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the damn rope, Randolph.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.14,0:07:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shutting this! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad. Very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.22,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:07:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.34,0:08:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's rumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what you do, Lady Brumaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's trickle, Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.90,0:08:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.22,0:08:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This got real ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I better tell Mama quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chouchou! Choo-choo-choo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Choo-choo-choo-choo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck on that, doops!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Once this train starts moving, there is\Nnobody in the world that can catch up to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.80,0:09:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.88,0:09:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing great! No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, dammit! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I can stop this train!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.73,0:10:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan really worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All clear here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.72,0:10:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.10,0:10:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can use Brule's power to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We can hop in and out of\Nany mirror we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start by searching\Nfor our other friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll check the mirrors like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,May I come in? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for going shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it ain't nothing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But, uh, I do have some news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.66,0:10:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out, We're holding Straw Hat and\Nthe Cat Burglar captive in the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They caught Luffy and Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't stress out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't want them\Ninterfering with the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you don't run away, the\Nwhole situation will tidy up nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then some of your other friends\Nare causing trouble in the Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It says Soul King and Jaguar\NMink are going on a rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet General Smoothie and Baron Tamago\Nwere apparently guarding the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Although the intruders\Nhave eluded them thus far,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,it's only a matter of\Ntime before they, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have my groceries? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want something really\Ngood, might I recommend eggplant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.74,0:11:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I use this kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.70,0:11:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding didn't show up for dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I should cook her something\Nin case she's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, ain't that a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's really got me worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard she's not feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real shame, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve\Nfor a damn pile of bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes, my good sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.02,0:12:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Swallow Bandarole!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a rather difficult\Nrequest of my dear associate,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but now he's risking his life for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So I must see this to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'll lose\Nface, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a face to\Nlose in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying I'm a skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,is the intruder in there with\Nmy treasure mama what are
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you doing down here i can handle\Nthis Let's fight on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, Smoothie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea whose\Ntreasure you're messing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, what a perfectly\Nunique creature you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.38,0:14:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The intruder is passing through\Nthe hallway near the courtyard now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Move in from both sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All hands, raise up your shields!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.86,0:15:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more and we've got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now that we're in the\Ncourt, God, he's done for! Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.68,0:15:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be plotting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the memory, she comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Pedro, formerly\Nof the Nox Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as mon adversaire, I must\Nextend you a measure of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I see you, I\Nfeel that strange old ache.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure the scar over your\Nleft eye feels identique as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:15:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,dites-moi, why would an homme Kuma Vice,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,who held onto life so\Nfiercely five years back,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Return here to repeat\Nthe same stupid mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have much longer\Nto live, mon adversaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.40,0:16:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, on that fateful day...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama stole away 50 years of\Nyour life, n 'est-ce pas?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I am well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.34,0:16:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made peace with my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm under no illusion that\NI'll make it out alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That was it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.58,0:17:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.96,0:17:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Curious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where to look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop sleeping, we're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're searching for a mirror\Nto the whole cave Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Diesel, do you know\Nhow this place works?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.18,0:18:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This place has access to\Nevery mirror on the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so one of them must be close to Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.34,0:18:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we're touching Barrel, we can\Nhop in and out as many times as we need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But at this rate, we're going\Nto be searching all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no point\Nin complaining about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.02,0:18:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do is keep looking for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.28,0:18:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So get ready for a long ride, Diesel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't stop that, you're\Ngoing to tear your hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.74,0:19:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasty idea! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy, stop! This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.16,0:19:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way for us to\Nget out of this stupid book!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to have my hands torn off\Neither, but I'll tell you one thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better than dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're stretched even\Nthinner than last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We sit and wait for someone\Nto come and save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.24,0:19:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll end up losing everything we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll sit here and suffer till Big Mom\Ndecides to kill us, and that's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not die like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You rip your hands off, too! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance! You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me do this my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop nagging me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.28,0:20:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see you\Ntear your own hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not gonna die in\Na dumb place like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot, I got carried away\Nand made way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think pudding's appetite\Nis this big, what was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, if she can't\Nfinish it then I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cooking skills are\Namazing, Sanji. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:20:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you have some, too? Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't possibly eat this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.56,0:21:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, ah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.34,0:21:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.86,0:21:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You taking a look, Sanji, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.56,0:21:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna enjoy the one and only\Nbeam of light that's left in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You want an eggplant for the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Never know. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stryhat and the Cat-Burgler are\Nalready in notre possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.62,0:22:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You may as well surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.06,0:22:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,May as well kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, un combat a la mort, d 'accord!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some anti-mink\Ntechnologique, one might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.36,0:22:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Planned ahead, I see. Oh, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.92,0:22:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing tights that protect\Nme from laser-tax-electrique.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.02,0:23:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A pair of tights won't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.18,0:23:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll settle this grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.62,0:23:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the whole cake Shit. Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.80,0:23:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Peckham's. Pedro! Zippo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.24,0:23:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you! Got you! Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.84,0:23:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you! Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Karoo, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.41,0:23:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a member of the Big Mom Pirates now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.28,0:23:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where I live, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.08,0:23:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Solo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll lose more than an eye this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.46,0:24:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A close shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.78,0:24:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My eye still leaks from\Ntime to time, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.84,0:24:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As if it records the pain of\Nbeing stabbed by your blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.00,0:24:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What Shigure faced that day was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.94,0:24:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you dirty thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.40,0:24:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mess you've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.54,0:24:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.96,0:24:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking a hundred\Nyears of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.08,0:24:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight it, Zippo! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.04,0:25:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Zippo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.66,0:25:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.80,0:25:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't nearly enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.80,0:25:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't have a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.50,0:25:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he only had 30 left in his
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.78,0:25:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,useless life too bad that means somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.26,0:25:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,else needs to pay the rest that falls\Non you since you're his partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.50,0:25:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,naughty boy now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.30,0:25:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking those 70 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.08,0:25:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope you have enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.94,0:25:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy, mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.20,0:25:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He was like a big brother to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.48,0:25:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,70 years is too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.44,0:25:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing short of a death sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.56,0:25:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.78,0:25:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.16,0:25:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm flagging you, mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.04,0:25:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.95,0:25:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.87,0:25:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.10,0:26:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,10 years, then I'll take\N10 years off his debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.00,0:26:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No more—that's all the mercy I have\Nfor the man who took Tomago's eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.86,0:26:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.62,0:26:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,price is 60 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.56,0:26:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.32,0:26:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,generous enough for you, Peckham's dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.68,0:26:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,dear
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.54,0:26:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.74,0:26:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, big mom
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.86,0:26:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How many years will this eye spare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.92,0:26:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.22,0:26:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The dawn of the new world is coming soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.88,0:26:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't rest until I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.82,0:26:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.72,0:27:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you a charmer?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.04,0:27:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it 50 years then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.56,0:27:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.74,0:27:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ex-Benedict!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.78,0:27:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A rescue Lancor. No answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.48,0:27:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you dare to return here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.42,0:27:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why relive the nightmare\Nof your companion's
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.70,0:27:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,demise over the day you\Nlost 50 years of your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.84,0:27:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,To help the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.80,0:27:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How else could I repay\Nthem for saving my home?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.42,0:27:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,More than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.76,0:27:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that they will bring forth the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.96,0:27:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,new world that I have\Ndreamt of for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.64,0:28:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro, the dawn of a new\Nday will come to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.64,0:28:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They will surpass you, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.50,0:28:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats will be the\Nheralds of a bright new age.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.08,0:28:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.34,0:28:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They have already been dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.40,0:28:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you expect those\Nfools to accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.42,0:28:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all Cake Island, n 'est-ce pas?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.42,0:28:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.00,0:28:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.40,0:28:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the choice I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.34,0:28:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, the meager time that I have\Nleft in this world, I offer to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.80,0:28:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.71,0:28:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake, Tamago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.08,0:28:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.80,0:28:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to lay down\Nthis sword until their
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.24,0:28:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,mission here is complete
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.32,0:29:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,my
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.16,0:29:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,fight
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.07,0:29:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't over no
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.82,0:29:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,means no lover boy pack\Nit up why not Because
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.38,0:29:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Pudding would like\Nher privacy go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.84,0:29:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What could she be doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.78,0:29:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just give this to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.56,0:29:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me slam in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.54,0:29:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.54,0:29:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there's a\Nbalcony outside her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.72,0:30:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pass it through the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.62,0:30:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.52,0:30:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She might think I'm peeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.70,0:30:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.14,0:30:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to be husband\Nand wife tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.76,0:30:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be seeing that sort\Nof thing all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.24,0:30:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing wrong with getting a sneak peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.86,0:30:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.78,0:30:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She's well enough to laugh, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.38,0:30:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's my sweet little pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.80,0:30:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is she talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.54,0:30:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Reizhou?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.72,0:31:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.64,0:31:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's pudding with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.00,0:31:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot honestly be that naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.98,0:31:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'd marry\Nthat lowlife pirate? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.04,0:31:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be out of your freaking mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.86,0:31:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.14,0:31:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm one of Mama's favorites, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.06,0:31:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially because of my acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.52,0:31:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, she cares for me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.88,0:31:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost overbearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.12,0:31:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fulsome stupid man from time to\Ntime in the old bag is happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.46,0:31:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was almost too easy\Ntricking the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.60,0:31:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Only my closest family knows\Nwhat my true nature really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.94,0:32:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.82,0:32:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What a ruckus.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.44,0:32:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going on for far too long. Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.32,0:32:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.42,0:32:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You really will rip your arms off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.74,0:32:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make her pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.80,0:32:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.80,0:32:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.68,0:32:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided I will not marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.26,0:32:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.24,0:32:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason why we're not getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.12,0:32:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is because that love—lorn fool\Nplayed right into my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.42,0:32:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.64,0:33:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,during the wedding ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.28,0:33:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.64,0:33:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,plan to shoot him full of holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.56,0:33:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.54,0:33:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,as for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.80,0:33:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not leaving this\Nplace alive either.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.24,0:33:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,either
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.26,0:33:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pudding, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.54,0:33:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.22,0:33:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, goodbye, you miserable little rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.62,0:33:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.20,0:33:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She was setting us up\Nto fail from the get-go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.18,0:33:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she doing this to Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.64,0:33:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so screwed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.00,0:33:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You people are so gullible!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.10,0:33:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And Germa 666 is supposed\Nto be an evil army!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.96,0:34:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep living in your\Nfantasy world, you twits!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.96,0:34:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve this!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.42,0:34:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama only wants two things from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.98,0:34:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your vast army of clone soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.96,0:34:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And your scientific technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.72,0:34:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you always listen to mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.22,0:34:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My such defiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.76,0:34:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That is exactly why we don't\Nneed you the entirety of the
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.80,0:34:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Germa kingdom is anchored\Nwithin our borders right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.10,0:34:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,like flies drawn to rotting fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.72,0:34:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The political marriage was meant\Nto entice you; it works so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.88,0:34:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You took the bait just as mama planned!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.96,0:34:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And at the wedding tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.12,0:35:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire Vin Smoke
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.40,0:35:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,family will be eliminated.
